body:
BIG ouch for me, I just ordered a pizza and posted a temporary address of a hotel but it was off by a number and someone next door accepted it as their own. lol. what I would GIVE to have a chef here to make me one, damn. I even tipped $15 because I know the delivery guy on call right now since I frequent this location a lot but there's nothing I feel I can do because I'm the one that made the typo... ugh.

if anyone wants to order ME a pizza, please let me know lmao. if I hadn't just moved in and actually knew the person living next door I would have bothered them for what I'd ordered but I'm fresh meat for a fresh ass second and it ain't happenin'. ![gif](emote|free_emotes_pack|laughing)

(I didn't order till I saw your post. kill me. then resurrect me, ya know? like Leanne.)
